{"id":"663597","name":"春笋焖鸡","author":"_蒍鉨变乖々","authorId":"8010238","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/663597/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"春笋","amount":"适量"},{"name":"鸡腿","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"葱花","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"鸡腿洗净斩块。","img":"images/663597/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"鸡腿肉加入适量玉米淀粉，蚝油，老抽抓拌均匀腌制入味。","img":"images/663597/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"春笋剥去外衣。","img":"images/663597/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"洗净后将春笋切块。","img":"images/663597/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"锅中水开放入春笋焯烫开捞出备用。","img":"images/663597/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"锅中热油放入鸡腿肉。","img":"images/663597/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"中小火煎至微微金黄。","img":"images/663597/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"放入春笋，加入少许生抽。","img":"images/663597/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"翻炒均匀入味。","img":"images/663597/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"加入适量清水。","img":"images/663597/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"中火焖五分钟左右入味即可。","img":"images/663597/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/663597/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/663597/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/663597/step_14.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}